# ARCHIVES_R — Logging functional studies and plans

This directory hosts the functional studies, analyses, and implementation plans written and validated by AI/LLM agents.

## Structure

```text
ARCHIVES_R/
├── claude-analyses/
├── gemini-analyses/
├── opencode-analyses/
└── qwen-analyses/
```

## Naming

Each study or plan is logged in Markdown format under the subfolder matching the active model/agent:
`ARCHIVES_R/{model}-analyses/YYYY-MM-DDTHH-MM-short-topic-name.md`

## Confidentiality rule

These documents are strictly local to the project. No publication to a third-party Cloud or Artifact service is allowed without explicit validation.
